msgid "Transpile an LUCJ ansatz {#transpile-an-lucj-ansatz}"
msgstr "Transpile ansatz LUCJ {#transpile-an-lucj-ansatz}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Important\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  The concepts in this guide are only available in the Python API.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Penting\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  Konsep-konsep di panduan ini hanya tersedia di API Python.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The local unitary cluster Jastrow ([LUCJ](https://pubs.rsc.org/en/content/articlelanding/2023/sc/d3sc02516k)) ansatz is a compact, hardware-efficient parametrization of a correlated electronic wavefunction. It is a member of the more general unitary cluster Jastrow (UCJ) family and takes the form\n"
msgstr "Ansatz local unitary cluster Jastrow ([LUCJ](https://pubs.rsc.org/en/content/articlelanding/2023/sc/d3sc02516k)) adalah parametrisasi yang ringkas dan efisien untuk hardware dari fungsi gelombang elektronik yang terkorelasi. Ini anggota dari keluarga unitary cluster Jastrow (UCJ) yang lebih umum dan berbentuk\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\lvert \\Psi \\rangle = \\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{L} \\mathcal{U}_k\\, e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}\\,\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger\\right) \\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\lvert \\Psi \\rangle = \\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{L} \\mathcal{U}_k\\, e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}\\,\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger\\right) \\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle$ is a reference state (typically Hartree-Fock), each $\\mathcal{U}_k$ is an orbital rotation, and each $\\mathcal{J}_k$ is a diagonal Coulomb operator\n"
msgstr "dengan $\\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle$ adalah state referensi (biasanya Hartree-Fock), tiap $\\mathcal{U}_k$ adalah rotasi orbital, dan tiap $\\mathcal{J}_k$ adalah operator Coulomb diagonal\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{J} = \\frac12 \\sum_{ij,\\sigma\\tau} \\mathbf{J}^{\\sigma\\tau}_{ij}\\,\n"
"n_{i\\sigma}\\, n_{j\\tau},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{J} = \\frac12 \\sum_{ij,\\sigma\\tau} \\mathbf{J}^{\\sigma\\tau}_{ij}\\,\n"
"n_{i\\sigma}\\, n_{j\\tau},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "with $n_{i\\sigma}$ the number operator on spatial orbital $i$ with spin $\\sigma$.\n"
msgstr "dengan $n_{i\\sigma}$ adalah operator bilangan pada orbital spasial $i$ dengan spin $\\sigma$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) builds the ansatz operator; this package turns it into a circuit and lowers that circuit onto qubits. This guide is about the second half of that sentence. The reason to make the trip is the lowering itself: ffsim’s own Qiskit gates are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation, whereas a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") carries no assumption about its fermion-to-qubit encoding, so the same ansatz can be synthesized through whichever encoding suits the target device.\n"
msgstr "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) membangun operator ansatz; package ini mengubahnya jadi circuit dan menurunkan circuit itu ke qubit. Panduan ini membahas bagian kedua dari kalimat tadi. Alasan menempuh jalur ini adalah proses penurunan itu sendiri: gate Qiskit milik ffsim khusus untuk transformasi Jordan-Wigner, sedangkan [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") tidak berasumsi apa pun soal encoding fermion-ke-qubit, sehingga ansatz yang sama bisa disintesis lewat encoding apa pun yang cocok dengan perangkat target.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ansatz operator therefore arrives here ready-made, and everything below is what happens to it afterwards: what the gate decomposes into, how it lowers through Jordan-Wigner, how it is matched to a device coupling map, and what a non-Jordan-Wigner lowering would still need. For building, parametrizing, or simulating a UCJ ansatz in the first place, see ffsim’s [own guides](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html).\n"
msgstr "Jadi operator ansatz tiba di sini dalam keadaan siap pakai, dan semua yang ada di bawah ini adalah apa yang terjadi padanya setelahnya: gate itu terurai menjadi apa, bagaimana ia diturunkan lewat Jordan-Wigner, bagaimana ia dicocokkan dengan coupling map perangkat, dan apa lagi yang masih dibutuhkan penurunan non-Jordan-Wigner. Untuk membangun, memparametrisasi, atau mensimulasikan ansatz UCJ sejak awal, lihat [panduan ffsim sendiri](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The [ffsim relationship guide](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) for how the two packages divide the work, and the [transpilation guide](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) for the pipeline stages used below.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Lihat juga\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [Panduan hubungan ffsim](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) untuk pembagian kerja kedua package, dan [panduan transpilasi](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) untuk tahap-tahap pipeline yang dipakai di bawah.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get an LUCJ operator from ffsim {#1-get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim}"
msgstr "1. Ambil operator LUCJ dari ffsim {#1-get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ansatz is initialized from the amplitudes of a coupled-cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) calculation. Run restricted Hartree-Fock followed by CCSD for a hydrogen molecule in the `6-31g` basis, using [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/) for the quantum chemistry, then hand the amplitudes to ffsim’s [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"). It performs a *double factorization* of the $t_2$ amplitudes to obtain the per-layer diagonal Coulomb matrices and orbital rotations, and derives an optional final orbital rotation from the $t_1$ amplitudes. The number of repetitions $L$ is whatever that factorization yields; `n_reps` truncates it, trading accuracy for a shallower circuit.\n"
msgstr "Ansatz diinisialisasi dari amplitudo perhitungan coupled-cluster singles and doubles (CCSD). Jalankan restricted Hartree-Fock lalu CCSD untuk molekul hidrogen di basis `6-31g`, dengan [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/) untuk kimia kuantumnya, lalu serahkan amplitudonya ke [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\") milik ffsim. Fungsi ini melakukan *double factorization* pada amplitudo $t_2$ untuk mendapatkan matriks Coulomb diagonal dan rotasi orbital per layer, dan menurunkan rotasi orbital akhir yang opsional dari amplitudo $t_1$. Jumlah pengulangan $L$ adalah apa pun hasil faktorisasi itu; `n_reps` memotongnya, menukar akurasi dengan circuit yang lebih dangkal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is where the ansatz stops being an ffsim concern. ffsim offers choices here that this package neither sees nor needs to know about, such as the variationally optimized (“compressed”) factorization behind `optimize=True`, or the parameter-vector packing that a variational optimizer drives. All of them produce the same kind of operator, and everything below works unchanged on any of them.\n"
msgstr "Di sinilah ansatz berhenti jadi urusan ffsim. ffsim menawarkan pilihan di sini yang tidak dilihat maupun perlu diketahui package ini, seperti faktorisasi (\"terkompresi\") yang dioptimalkan secara variasional di balik `optimize=True`, atau pengemasan vektor parameter yang dikendalikan oleh optimizer variasional. Semuanya menghasilkan jenis operator yang sama, dan semua yang ada di bawah berjalan tanpa perubahan pada salah satunya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Turn the operator into a fermionic circuit {#2-turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit}"
msgstr "2. Ubah operator jadi fermionic circuit {#2-turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") gate wraps the operator and expresses it as a circuit over *fermionic modes*. The gate is a pure unitary carrying no reference of its own, so prepend an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate (built with [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) to supply the Hartree-Fock reference the ansatz is applied to.\n"
msgstr "Gate [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") membungkus operator dan mengekspresikannya sebagai circuit di atas *mode fermionik*. Gate ini adalah unitary murni tanpa referensi sendiri, jadi tambahkan gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") di depannya (dibuat dengan [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) untuk menyediakan referensi Hartree-Fock tempat ansatz diterapkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Decomposing the circuit reveals its anatomy, and this is the representation the rest of the guide operates on. The [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate prepares the reference determinant, and each ansatz layer contributes an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") $\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger$, then $e^{i\\mathcal{J}_k}$ (an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") of the diagonal Coulomb operator $\\mathcal{J}_k$), then $\\mathcal{U}_k$, with a final [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") at the end. The orbital rotations act per spin sector, so each is placed on the alpha modes `0..norb` and the beta modes `norb..2*norb` independently.\n"
msgstr "Mendekomposisi circuit memperlihatkan anatominya, dan inilah representasi yang jadi dasar kerja sisa panduan ini. Gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") menyiapkan determinan referensi, dan tiap layer ansatz menyumbang sebuah [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") $\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger$, lalu $e^{i\\mathcal{J}_k}$ (sebuah [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") dari operator Coulomb diagonal $\\mathcal{J}_k$), lalu $\\mathcal{U}_k$, dengan [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") terakhir di ujung. Rotasi orbital bekerja per sektor spin, jadi masing-masing ditempatkan pada mode alpha `0..norb` dan mode beta `norb..2*norb` secara independen.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The gates that the UCJ ansatz decomposes into.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The gates that the UCJ ansatz decomposes into.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-3.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every gate in that decomposition is still fermionic: [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") and [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") are defined on modes, and no qubit or Pauli operator has appeared yet. That is what leaves the encoding open, and it is the state the ansatz stays in until the synthesis stage picks one.\n"
msgstr "Setiap gate dalam dekomposisi itu masih fermionik: [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") dan [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") didefinisikan pada mode, dan belum ada qubit atau operator Pauli yang muncul. Itulah yang membuat encoding tetap terbuka, dan ansatz tetap berada di keadaan ini sampai tahap sintesis memilih satu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Each layer ends with $\\mathcal{U}_k$ and the next begins with $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$, so adjacent [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates could be merged into a single rotation. A transpilation pass performing this fusion is a planned future development.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Catatan\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Tiap layer berakhir dengan $\\mathcal{U}_k$ dan layer berikutnya dimulai dengan $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$, jadi gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") yang bersebelahan bisa digabung jadi satu rotasi. Pass transpilasi yang melakukan fusi ini direncanakan untuk pengembangan mendatang.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Choose a fermion-to-qubit encoding {#3-choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding}"
msgstr "3. Pilih encoding fermion-ke-qubit {#3-choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit is still fermionic, and that is the point at which this package earns its place in the workflow. A [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") carries no assumption about how modes become qubits, so the encoding is a *synthesis-stage* choice rather than something baked into the ansatz. That is what this package adds over ffsim’s own Qiskit gates, which are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation.\n"
msgstr "Circuit ini masih fermionik, dan di titik inilah package ini menunjukkan gunanya dalam workflow. [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") tidak berasumsi bagaimana mode menjadi qubit, jadi encoding adalah pilihan di *tahap sintesis*, bukan sesuatu yang tertanam di ansatz. Itulah nilai tambah package ini dibanding gate Qiskit milik ffsim, yang khusus untuk transformasi Jordan-Wigner.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For Jordan-Wigner alone you would not need this detour: ffsim ships [`UCJOpSpinBalancedJW`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW.html#ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW \"(in ffsim)\") and its siblings, which take a UCJ operator to a qubit circuit on their own. The reason to route the ansatz through a fermionic circuit is everything *else* an encoding can buy you. Local encodings, for instance, spend extra qubits to bound the Pauli weight of each term, which the [1D](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) and [2D](2-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) flow-set guides use to make a Trotter step’s two-qubit depth independent of the system size.\n"
msgstr "Untuk Jordan-Wigner saja, kamu tidak butuh jalan memutar ini: ffsim menyediakan [`UCJOpSpinBalancedJW`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW.html#ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW \"(in ffsim)\") dan saudara-saudaranya, yang bisa membawa operator UCJ ke circuit qubit sendirian. Alasan melewatkan ansatz lewat fermionic circuit adalah segala hal *lain* yang bisa diberikan sebuah encoding. Encoding lokal, misalnya, mengorbankan qubit tambahan untuk membatasi bobot Pauli tiap suku, yang dimanfaatkan panduan flow-set [1D](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) dan [2D](2-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) agar depth two-qubit satu langkah Trotter tidak bergantung pada ukuran sistem.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a UCJ ansatz specifically, the synthesis stage has to cover two kinds of gate:\n"
msgstr "Khusus untuk ansatz UCJ, tahap sintesis harus mencakup dua jenis gate:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The diagonal Coulomb evolution.** [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") is already encoding-agnostic: [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\") takes a mapper function, so the $e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}$ layers lower through any encoding you can express as one. The [flow-set guides](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) show how to write one.\n"
msgstr "**Evolusi Coulomb diagonal.** [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") sudah agnostik terhadap encoding: [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\") menerima sebuah fungsi mapper, jadi layer $e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}$ diturunkan lewat encoding apa pun yang bisa kamu ekspresikan sebagai fungsi mapper. [Panduan flow-set](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) menunjukkan cara menulisnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The orbital rotations and the Slater-determinant preparation.** Neither an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") nor the [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") that the leading [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and rotation fuse into (see below) is mapped to qubits as such. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass first breaks them down, in fermionic space, into [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gates on one or two modes each (and, for the preparation, an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference), so any encoding that can map an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") handles them. Under Jordan-Wigner, the factors between adjacent modes become [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects at the qubit stage.\n"
msgstr "**Rotasi orbital dan persiapan Slater-determinant.** Baik [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") maupun [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") yang jadi hasil fusi dari [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") di depan dan rotasinya (lihat di bawah) tidak di-map ke qubit begitu saja. Pass [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") lebih dulu memecahnya, di ruang fermionik, menjadi gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") pada satu atau dua mode masing-masing (dan, untuk persiapan, sebuah [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") dari referensi), sehingga encoding apa pun yang bisa me-map sebuah [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") bisa menanganinya. Di bawah Jordan-Wigner, faktor antar mode bersebelahan menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)pada tahap qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The initialization.** The plugin for [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") is not parametrized by an encoding: it documents its assumption of an occupation-basis encoding with a 1-to-1 mode-to-qubit mapping, and emits gates directly on that basis. A different encoding needs its own plugin for it, and none ships yet.\n"
msgstr "**Inisialisasi.** Plugin untuk [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") tidak diparametrisasi oleh encoding: plugin ini mendokumentasikan asumsinya berupa encoding basis okupasi dengan mapping mode-ke-qubit 1-ke-1, dan langsung mengeluarkan gate pada basis itu. Encoding yang berbeda butuh plugin sendiri untuk ini, dan belum ada yang disediakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to transpile UCJ circuits under a non-Jordan-Wigner encoding is an open research question and this package provides the framework within which to develop such a pipeline. The remainder of this guide constructs the transpiler pipeline for the Jordan-Wigner encoding, equivalent to the one produced by [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), as an example.\n"
msgstr "Cara mentranspilasi circuit UCJ di bawah encoding non-Jordan-Wigner masih merupakan pertanyaan riset terbuka, dan package ini menyediakan kerangka untuk mengembangkan pipeline semacam itu. Sisa panduan ini menyusun pipeline transpiler untuk encoding Jordan-Wigner, setara dengan yang dihasilkan oleh [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), sebagai contoh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"lower-it-through-jordan-wigner\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Lower it through Jordan-Wigner {#4-lower-it-through-jordan-wigner}"
msgstr "4. Turunkan lewat Jordan-Wigner {#4-lower-it-through-jordan-wigner}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lowering happens in [`F2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis\"), which works like Qiskit’s [`HighLevelSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HighLevelSynthesis): it walks the fermionic instructions and hands each to a plugin registered for that gate name. Its [`F2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods\") attribute holds one [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\") per gate name, so building the stage means choosing a plugin for every fermionic gate the circuit contains:\n"
msgstr "Penurunan terjadi di [`F2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis\"), yang cara kerjanya mirip [`HighLevelSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HighLevelSynthesis) milik Qiskit: ia menelusuri instruksi fermionik dan menyerahkan tiap instruksi ke plugin yang terdaftar untuk nama gate tersebut. Atribut [`F2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods\") menyimpan satu [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\") per nama gate, jadi menyusun tahap ini berarti memilih plugin untuk setiap gate fermionik yang ada di circuit:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigning instances like this is also how a plugin you wrote yourself enters the pipeline, without having to register it anywhere first.\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan instance seperti ini juga cara plugin buatanmu sendiri masuk ke pipeline, tanpa perlu mendaftarkannya di mana pun lebih dulu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is where the encoding is settled, in the two ways section 3 described: explicitly, by handing [`jordan_wigner()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/mappers-library-jordan-wigner#qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner \"qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner\") to [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\"), and implicitly, by the other plugin already assuming it.\n"
msgstr "Di sinilah encoding ditetapkan, lewat dua cara yang dijelaskan di bagian 3: secara eksplisit, dengan menyerahkan [`jordan_wigner()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/mappers-library-jordan-wigner#qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner \"qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner\") ke [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\"), dan secara implisit, lewat plugin lain yang sudah mengasumsikannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "That stage then slots into a [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) whose stages run in a fixed order:\n"
msgstr "Tahap itu lalu dimasukkan ke [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) yang tahapnya berjalan dalam urutan tetap:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The **optimization** stage runs *before* synthesis, on the fermionic circuit, which is what makes it worth having: it rewrites gates while they are still fermionic and encoding-agnostic, so the savings carry to whatever encoding follows. [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") collapses each run of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates into one, which matters for a UCJ ansatz because every layer ends with $\\mathcal{U}_k$ and the next begins with $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$. [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") then fuses the leading [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and the rotation that follows it into a single [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), which synthesis lowers through the cheaper reduced Slater decomposition instead of a full square rotation. The order matters: merging the rotations first exposes the single rotation immediately after the initialization, which the Slater fusion then contracts into it. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") comes last, because it breaks up whatever rotation is left, and doing so any earlier would leave the two merging passes with nothing to fuse.\n"
msgstr "Tahap **optimization** berjalan *sebelum* sintesis, pada fermionic circuit, dan inilah yang membuatnya berharga: ia menulis ulang gate selagi masih fermionik dan agnostik terhadap encoding, sehingga penghematannya terbawa ke encoding apa pun yang menyusul. [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") menyatukan tiap rangkaian gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") yang berurutan menjadi satu, yang penting untuk ansatz UCJ karena setiap layer berakhir dengan $\\mathcal{U}_k$ dan layer berikutnya dimulai dengan $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$. [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") kemudian meleburkan [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") di depan dan rotasi sesudahnya menjadi satu [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), yang oleh sintesis diturunkan lewat dekomposisi Slater tereduksi yang lebih murah, bukan rotasi persegi penuh. Urutannya penting: menggabungkan rotasi lebih dulu memunculkan satu rotasi tepat setelah inisialisasi, yang kemudian dilebur ke dalamnya oleh fusi Slater. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") ada paling akhir, karena ia memecah rotasi apa pun yang tersisa, dan melakukannya lebih awal akan membuat dua pass penggabung tidak punya apa-apa untuk dilebur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The remaining stages are plumbing. `input` and `output` convert between circuits and DAGs, `layout` assigns fermionic modes to qubits ([`TrivialF2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-trivial-f-2-q-layout#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout\") maps mode `i` to qubit `i`), and `qubit` is an ordinary Qiskit pass manager that takes over once nothing fermionic is left.\n"
msgstr "Tahap-tahap sisanya hanyalah pipa penghubung. `input` dan `output` mengonversi antara circuit dan DAG, `layout` menetapkan mode fermionik ke qubit ([`TrivialF2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-trivial-f-2-q-layout#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout\") me-map mode `i` ke qubit `i`), dan `qubit` adalah pass manager Qiskit biasa yang mengambil alih begitu tidak ada lagi yang fermionik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running it requires one preparatory step: the composite [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") gate has to be decomposed into its primitive gates first, so the optimization stage can see the individual rotations and evolutions.\n"
msgstr "Menjalankannya butuh satu langkah persiapan: gate komposit [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") harus didekomposisi dulu menjadi gate primitifnya, supaya tahap optimization bisa melihat rotasi dan evolusi satu per satu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without a target device, this maps onto `2 * norb` qubits with all-to-all connectivity assumed; the orbital rotations synthesize into [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects and the diagonal Coulomb evolutions into [`RZZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate)objects:\n"
msgstr "Tanpa perangkat target, ini di-map ke `2 * norb` qubit dengan asumsi konektivitas all-to-all; rotasi orbital disintesis menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)dan evolusi Coulomb diagonal menjadi objek [`RZZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pipeline is exactly what [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\") assembles, so reach for the preset in practice and build the stages by hand when you need to change one of them:\n"
msgstr "Pipeline inilah yang dirakit oleh [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), jadi dalam praktik pakai preset-nya, dan susun tahap-tahapnya secara manual hanya kalau kamu perlu mengubah salah satunya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"match-the-device-topology\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Match the device topology {#5-match-the-device-topology}"
msgstr "5. Sesuaikan dengan topologi perangkat {#5-match-the-device-topology}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A real device has a restricted qubit coupling map, and the LUCJ ansatz is designed to match it. The same-spin (`pairs_aa`) interactions form two linear chains and the alpha-beta (`pairs_ab`) interactions bridge them. ffsim’s [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") builds a device-aware qubit pipeline for this structure, and returns the subset of `pairs_ab` the hardware can actually accommodate. Slot that pipeline into the preset’s `qubit` stage while keeping the package’s own fermion-to-qubit synthesis:\n"
msgstr "Perangkat nyata punya coupling map qubit yang terbatas, dan ansatz LUCJ dirancang agar cocok dengannya. Interaksi spin-sama (`pairs_aa`) membentuk dua rantai linear dan interaksi alpha-beta (`pairs_ab`) menjembatani keduanya. [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") milik ffsim membangun pipeline qubit yang sadar-perangkat untuk struktur ini, dan mengembalikan subset `pairs_ab` yang benar-benar bisa ditampung hardware. Masukkan pipeline itu ke tahap `qubit` milik preset sambil mempertahankan sintesis fermion-ke-qubit bawaan package ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "That composition is the point: the `qubit` stage is device-aware, while the fermion-to-qubit synthesis stage ahead of it stays this package’s own, and so stays replaceable. Replacing the `qubit` stage does drop what the preset registers there, which is the [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") that turns the Givens factors of an orbital rotation into [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects. Pass it on through the `hls_config` as above, or the device’s basis has to be reached without it.\n"
msgstr "Komposisi itulah intinya: tahap `qubit` sadar-perangkat, sementara tahap sintesis fermion-ke-qubit di depannya tetap milik package ini, sehingga tetap bisa diganti. Mengganti tahap `qubit` memang menghilangkan apa yang didaftarkan preset di situ, yaitu [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") yang mengubah faktor Givens dari rotasi orbital menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)Teruskan lewat `hls_config` seperti di atas, atau basis perangkat harus dicapai tanpanya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `pm.qubit` now set to the device-aware pipeline, running the pass manager lays the circuit out on the backend’s qubits and routes it to the coupling map. For the *unrestricted* ansatz from step 1, whose diagonal Coulomb operator still contains alpha-beta terms the hardware cannot reach directly, the router must insert many `SWAP` gates to bridge them:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `pm.qubit` sekarang diatur ke pipeline yang sadar-perangkat, menjalankan pass manager akan menata circuit pada qubit backend dan merutekannya ke coupling map. Untuk ansatz yang *tidak dibatasi* dari langkah 1, yang operator Coulomb diagonalnya masih berisi suku alpha-beta yang tidak bisa dijangkau hardware secara langsung, router harus menyisipkan banyak gate `SWAP` untuk menjembataninya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Restrict the ansatz to the hardware-implementable interactions**\n"
msgstr "**Batasi ansatz pada interaksi yang bisa diimplementasikan hardware**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fix is to feed `allowed_pairs_ab` back into the ansatz construction, through the `interaction_pairs` argument of [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), so the diagonal Coulomb operator only contains alpha-beta terms the coupling map can implement directly. The ansatz then matches the device topology and the router barely has to touch it:\n"
msgstr "Solusinya adalah memasukkan `allowed_pairs_ab` kembali ke konstruksi ansatz, lewat argumen `interaction_pairs` dari [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), sehingga operator Coulomb diagonal hanya berisi suku alpha-beta yang bisa diimplementasikan langsung oleh coupling map. Ansatz lalu cocok dengan topologi perangkat dan router nyaris tidak perlu menyentuhnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing only the active qubits (`idle_wires=False`) shows the circuit restricted to the two spin chains and the alpha-beta bridge, expressed in the device basis gates. Layout and routing scatter the logical modes across the device’s physical qubits, so pass a `wire_order` taken from the circuit’s final layout ([`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) lists the physical qubit each input qubit ended on, in input-qubit order) to draw the wires back in the original mode order:\n"
msgstr "Menggambar hanya qubit yang aktif (`idle_wires=False`) menunjukkan circuit yang dibatasi pada dua rantai spin dan jembatan alpha-beta, diekspresikan dalam basis gate perangkat. Layout dan routing menyebar mode logis ke seluruh qubit fisik perangkat, jadi berikan `wire_order` yang diambil dari layout akhir circuit ([`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) mendaftar qubit fisik tempat tiap qubit input berakhir, berurutan sesuai qubit input) untuk menggambar wire kembali dalam urutan mode semula:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The exact post-layout gate counts and depth depend on the routing/optimization passes and the chosen device, so they are not reproduced here. The key point is the co-design; expressing the ansatz with a nearest-neighbor `pairs_aa` chain and hardware-filtered `pairs_ab` bridges keeps the synthesized circuit close to the device topology, minimizing the routing overhead (inserted `SWAP` gates). See [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") for a related synthesis choice (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), trading two-qubit gate count against routed depth.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Catatan\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Jumlah gate dan depth persis setelah layout bergantung pada pass routing/optimasi dan perangkat yang dipilih, jadi tidak ditampilkan di sini. Poin pentingnya adalah co-design; mengekspresikan ansatz dengan rantai `pairs_aa` tetangga-terdekat dan jembatan `pairs_ab` yang difilter hardware menjaga circuit hasil sintesis tetap dekat dengan topologi perangkat, meminimalkan overhead routing (gate `SWAP` yang disisipkan). Lihat [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") untuk pilihan sintesis terkait (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), yang menukar jumlah gate two-qubit dengan depth hasil routing.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

